#1282 KS-730 PR 1 of 3 (T1). systemErrors.ts: four inline 500 handlers -> fail500; #1182's two ingest routes keep their own inline logs by design (the seat: "2 inline logger.error calls, 4 fail500 call sites"). RED PROOF (mandatory): systemErrors.ts at the parent -> the seat's five arms (arms730a.py, b29-730a-arms.out: "the original ternary restored at each of the four sites separately, each reddening exactly that route's two cells, plus the helper's log removed") with assertion text; restore by bytes. The cell file ks730a-ingest-500-never-answers-err-message.test.ts EXISTED at the base and is EXTENDED (+85/-5): say what its pre-existing cells assert and that none was weakened (READ the five removed lines). DOCBLOCK-DISPLACED (READ): fail500's docblock sits between the ingest route's own one-line docblock and the route.

#1283 KS-730 PR 2 of 3 (T1). gdpr.ts: fifteen inline 500 handlers -> fail500, and a NEW `import { logger } from '../utils/logger'` in a file that said it must never import it. RED PROOF (mandatory): gdpr.ts at the parent -> the seat's five arms (arms730b.py, b29-730b-arms.out) with assertion text; restore by bytes. The import claim: "utils/logger.ts imports winston and nothing else, and importing it with DATABASE_URL and JWT_SECRET both deleted SUCCEEDS" and "All six suites that import this router are run and pass (78/78)" (b29-730b-six.out) — re-measure both: import utils/logger with those two variables unset (a node process, stdout/stderr separate) and run every suite that imports routes/gdpr at head, and say whether any suite that mocks '../utils/logger' now behaves differently. STALE-COMMENT-532 (READ, the drafter's): the head commit message says "The comment is corrected in place rather than contradicted silently", yet the head file still carries, at line 532, "Deliberately no logger import in this file: `utils/logger` pulls in `config.ts`, which THROWS at module load when DATABASE_URL is unset" — while the same file now imports the logger at line 21 and the new docblock at :201 contradicts it by reference. Measure the line at head, rule whether the message's claim is false, and say what a reader of :532 now believes. DOCBLOCK-DISPLACED as #1282.

